1
00:00:02,919 --> 00:00:04,370
It was my first time, okay?

2
00:00:04,370 --> 00:00:09,005
Listen— let me warn you. Next time, think carefully.

3
00:00:09,005 --> 00:00:11,701
Before you book a room and
meet someone random like that—

4
00:00:11,701 --> 00:00:17,081
You need to talk it through with the person first. Otherwise you lose money, or worse.

5
00:00:17,765 --> 00:00:20,891
If it wasn't me last night?
You would've been in real trouble.

6
00:00:20,891 --> 00:00:24,918
Someone as innocent and clueless as you could easily get tricked.

7
00:00:32,719 --> 00:00:34,401
So why did you want to try it?

8
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:37,560
No reason… I just wanted to try.

9
00:00:46,280 --> 00:00:50,480
Mr. Narongsak,
please proceed to Exam Room 4.

10
00:00:50,480 --> 00:00:52,203
There— Room 4.

11
00:00:52,203 --> 00:00:53,741
Uh— thanks.

12
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:12,731
So… what did the doctor say?

13
00:01:15,759 --> 00:01:17,810
Just a small abrasion.

14
00:01:17,810 --> 00:01:20,910
And when I moved, it rubbed against it—
that's why it bled.

15
00:01:23,782 --> 00:01:27,161
Good that it's nothing serious.
You know, I was so nervous outside.

16
00:01:27,161 --> 00:01:29,883
At this rate, I felt like *I* was waiting for
an ultrasound or something.

17
00:01:34,951 --> 00:01:36,951
Mr. Narongsak,
please collect your medication.

18
00:01:46,934 --> 00:01:48,096
Thank you.

19
00:01:49,931 --> 00:01:51,969
Hey— why are you holding me? Let go.

20
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:56,604
I told the nurse we were dating.

21
00:01:56,604 --> 00:01:58,234
Gotta act the part a little, right?

22
00:02:00,097 --> 00:02:01,174
Thank you.

23
00:02:05,285 --> 00:02:07,285
They're so cute.
